    "note": [
        {
            "structuredValue": [],
            "parallelValue": [],
            "groupedValue": [],
            "value": "\"This CD-ROM contains data and map files of a digital bathymetric surface model of the Gulf of Mexico, intracoastal waterway and Tampa Bay in West-Central Florida, USA. It was designed to assist in the understanding of sediment distribution and coastal processes. The surface model was generated from National Oceanic and Atmospheric Administration (NOAA) Hydrographic Survey data collected in the 1950's and 1970's.\"",
